Ralph suggested also pinning down the resulting script (https://git.fish.foo/bitcoin/bitcoin/pulls/36386#issuecomment-608275), which seems fair enough.

Guess it could be done through:
```suggestion
    BOOST_CHECK(restored.IsUnspendable());
    const CScript expected{OP_RETURN};
